    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The magic of your patron ensures you always have certain spells ready; when you reach a Warlock level specified in the Ironwood Spells table, you thereafter always have the listed spells prepared.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Warlock Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>Barkskin, Entangle, Goodberry, Heat Metal</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Plant Growth, Speak with Plants</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Giant Insect, Grasping Vine</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>Awaken, Commune with Nature</td></tr></tbody></table><ul><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.e0366831c95504f9]{Barkskin}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.d6c87404b9d8184c]{Entangle}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.5f3cd8e022501590]{Goodberry}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.2208125b4d88f7f6]{Heat Metal}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.76f89c411c4df235]{Plant Growth}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.6ac3e46840673ddf]{Speak with Plants}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.ce6cfece857981f0]{Giant Insect}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.2934d53fe730fa7e]{Grasping Vine}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.af84e76851318236]{Awaken}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.0e7cefca61452128]{Commune with Nature}</li></ul>"
